  "body": [
    "At Continental, we are driven by the desire to revolutionize the future of mobility. And with the right people are on board, we can make a real difference. With us, you develop solutions that make tomorrow’s mobility even safer, more comfortable, and more sustainable.",
    "You can choose the path that suits your skills, interests and personal goals. Whether you want to aim high or stay grounded – we’ve got you covered. Sounds good? Then discover our career opportunities and get the career you really want.",
    "Our people are driven by their passion to create and desire to make a meaningful positive change.",
    "The fastest way to the perfect job!",
    "Employing top talent across the world, we work together as a global team – because no one shapes the future alone.",
    "Driven by their passion to create and desire for positive change. Learn what keeps our people moving.",
    "Over 50 locations in the U.S. and Canada across all business areas.",
    "Learn how our engineers are solving some of the world's biggest issues with smart cities and intelligent mobility.",
    "We're looking for people eager to shape the future.",
    "Continental is all about curiosity, innovation, and keeping the future in motion. Learn about the teams who make it all possible.",
    "🌟 Help Continental Shine on National Intern Day! We’re excited to share that Continental’s Internship Program has been nominated for the Yello &amp; WayUp 2026…",
    "Big things are happening in Mount Vernon! ✨ Continental is continuing to invest in the future with plans for a highly automated warehouse at the Mount Vernon t…",
    "From pod racers to daily drivers, the Force is strong with good tires.🌠",
    "Please join us in celebrating Sumter! We're extending huge congratulations to our Sumter team for winning Best Manufacturing Plant in the Best of Sumter Awards for the third year in a row! We're proud to have our amazing Sumter team recognized for all their hard work, dedication, and commitment. 💛",
    "We did it again! Our amazing Mt. Vernon team hosted their annual tire recycling event this past weekend to close out Earth Month! We're so proud of everyone in our Conti family who shows up and supports sustainability. 🌍♻️How did you celebrate Earth Month?",
    "We're so proud to share that our Sumter plant manager JJ Dowling has been selected as an Honorary Commander at Shaw Air Force Base in Sumter, SC. The Shaw Air…",
    "We are proud to announce that the repaving campaign at Uvalde Proving Grounds has been completed! The project was completed in just 71 days, restoring key testi…",
    "Continental showed up in a big way at Bimmer Invasion 2026 in West Palm Beach, joining a massive celebration of the BMW community with nearly 15,000 spectators and 1,500+ show cars. From sponsoring the Burnout competition to spending the day with BMW CCA and enthusiasts, it was all about high energy, performance, tire talk, and good times on and off the track.",
    "🔍 Can you crack the Continental Word Search? We’ve hidden the names of 5 Continental USA locations in this puzzle. 👀 👉 Step 1: Find the first word that catch…",
    "🚀 Our eXplore Tires Graduate Program is back for 2026! We’re offering global trainee opportunities in Manufacturing, Engineering &amp; Quality Management. This…",
    "A house becomes a home! 💛Yesterday we celebrated the dedication ceremony of the Habitat for Humanity home we were proud to sponsor and welcomed a family into their new beginning. We're so proud of everyone from our #ContiFamily who made this possible!",
    "What do BYD, Volkswagen, Stellantis, BMW, NIO, Hyundai and Renault have in common? They all trust our expertise for their battery electric vehicles (BEVs). In fact, 17 of the 20 highest-volume BEV manufacturers worldwide rely on our premium tires. Find out why: ow.ly/UjJM50YEzWB"
  ],
